        <item>
            <title>0.14.72</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 09:40:28 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>133</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.72</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>On-device transcription now self-heals when the local model is incomplete. A corrupt or partially-downloaded model (an unreadable weights file) used to fail the whole recording; now the app detects it, re-downloads the model clean, and transcribes, instead of landing the meeting in &quot;failed&quot;.</li>
<li>Profile menu polish: the green Sign in button has slightly rounder corners, and the Get help / Check for updates group gets a little more breathing room above and below.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
